      <description><![CDATA[<p>Blit 1.0.10. Clicking a Blit notification, or Open Blit in the menu bar, now brings back the window you have (from the Dock, a hidden Blit, or another stage or desktop) instead of opening a second one. A new window opens only when you've closed the last.</p>]]></description>
